#: site/app/addition/menu.json.php:9
msgid "sverige-amerika-centrets-emigrantfotosamling"
msgstr "sverige-amerika-centrets-emigrantfotosamling"

#: site/app/addition/menu.json.php:9
msgid ""
"Samlingen består av emigrantfotografier insamlade vid Sverige Amerika "
"Centret i Karlstad. De flesta av emigranterna är relaterade till Värmland. "
"Fotografierna är till största del tagna på 1900-talets första hälft men även "
"några tidigare och senare. Totalt består samlingen av cirka 1700 fotografier "
"med tillhörande index. Fotografierna har som regel länk till databasen "
"\"Emigranter registrerade i svenska kyrkböcker\". Uppgifter om "
"originalfotonas ägare finns men kan ej publiceras pga gällande lagstiftning. "
"Kontakta Sverige Amerika Centret för mer information.Databasen är skapad av "
"Sverige Amerika Centret i Karlstad."
msgstr ""
"The collection consists of emigrant photographs collected at the Sweden "
"America Center in Karlstad. Most of the emigrants are related to Värmland. "
"The photographs are mostly taken in the first half of the 20th century, but "
"also some earlier and later. In total, the collection consists of "
"approximately 1,700 photographs with associated indexes. The photographs "
"usually have a link to the database \"Emigrants registered in Swedish church "
"records\". Information about the owners of the original photos is available "
"but cannot be published due to current legislation. Contact Sweden America "
"Center for more information. The database was created by Sweden America "
"Center in Karlstad."

#: site/app/addition/menu.json.php:10
msgid "riksforeningens-arkiv"
msgstr "riksforeningens-arkiv"

#: site/app/addition/menu.json.php:10
msgid ""
"Riksföreningen Sverigekontakt, organisation som bistår svenskar och "
"svenskättlingar utomlands, söker bevara svenska språket bland dem, sprider "
"kännedom i utlandet om svensk kultur och vårdar svenskminnen utomlands. R. "
"har sitt säte i Göteborg. Den hette 1908-79 Riksföreningen för svenskhetens "
"bevarande i utlandet."
msgstr ""
"Riksföreningen Sverigekontakt, an organization that assists Swedes and "
"Swedish descendants abroad, seeks to preserve the Swedish language among "
"them, spreads knowledge abroad about Swedish culture and preserves Swedish "
"memories abroad. R. is based in Gothenburg. In 1908-79 it was called the "
"National Association for the Preservation of Swedishness Abroad."

